    "text": "4 hours ago SPARTA, Tenn. (WSMV) - The Sparta Police Department is asking for the public’s help in locating a woman who was last seen on Oct. 8. SPD said Nikkie Roberts Simmons was last seen around Swindell Street in Sparta on Thursday, Oct. 8. She has not been heard from and did not take her phone or belongings with her, police said. Read full article\n1",
